<h2 id="sensitive-dorks">Sensitive Dorks</h2>

<p>Sensitive Dorks are used to find the sensitve file and hidden files which website does not want to show or mistakely exposed to the google ? yes such file get disclosed because developers don’t add deindex tag or if they have specific endpoint for uploading the such documents like <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">admin/information/userdata1.pdf</code> while such enpoint should be disallowed using robots.txt but sometimes developers forgot to add such enpoint directory to robots.txt which cause to index on search engines like google.</p>

<p>Dorks I use for finding sensitive files are :</p>

